  - episode of care
  - AHRQ
  - HCUP
abstract: >-
  Python implementation of the AHRQ Elixhauser Comorbidity Index with
  van Walraven scoring. Maps 4,568 ICD-10-CM diagnosis codes to 38
  comorbidity categories and calculates composite risk scores for
  mortality and readmission prediction. Based on AHRQ HCUP Elixhauser
  Comorbidity Software Refined for ICD-10-CM (v2026.1). CDC-reviewed.
  Designed for integration into claims-based episode analytics,
  EHR-based prospective risk assessment, and clinical AI pipelines.
